{"unit_id":"likhonmain__voice-input#card-zh","repo":"likhonmain/voice-input","commit":"4a3c0ad30a20b5d2a3db907ed01d436a52430f93","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-voice-input（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：在输入框旁提供语音录制和转写，让用户无需离开会话编辑器即可把口述内容变成草稿。它将麦克风控件接入 conversation.input.activity 插槽，并由本机服务将音频转发到用户配置的 OpenAI 兼容接口。主要功能包括录音暂停与续录、回放检查、选择转写服务，以及把识别文本插入草稿。适合希望用语音起草 DSH 消息的网页用户。使用前需要麦克风权限、服务 URL 和 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1448-1452","client.js:738-774","client.js:960-1002","index.js:289-292"]}
{"unit_id":"likhonmain__voice-input#card-en","repo":"likhonmain/voice-input","commit":"4a3c0ad30a20b5d2a3db907ed01d436a52430f93","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-voice-input (web DSH plugin): Adds composer microphone controls to record, pause, review, and transcribe speech into a draft. Its host service forwards audio to a configured OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Dictate messages with microphone permission, provider URL, and API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1448-1452","client.js:738-774","client.js:960-1002","index.js:289-292"]}
